'''Doge Dark''' (殺意のわんこ, ''Satsui no Wanko'', '''Killer Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]], and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

