==Trivia==
*Doge Dark's Japanese name (殺意のわんこ ''Satsui no Wanko'', "Killer Doggy") may be a reference to [[wikia:streetfighter:Satsui no Hado|Satsui no Hadō]] from Capcom's ''[[wikipedia:Street Fighter|Street Fighter]]'' series. Satsui no Hadō is a state in which the possessed become stronger and more violent, usually gaining spiky hair and a darker color palette along with an "Evil/Dark" prefix in their name.
*It can be presumed that Doge Dark came to be after finding one of Assassin Bear's distributed flyers.

